{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"ResumeKit"}],"symbolKind":"class","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionCoordinator"}],"roleHeading":"Class","title":"SessionCoordinator","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:9ResumeKit18SessionCoordinatorC","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionCoordinator","kind":"identifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ResumeKit\/documentation\/ResumeKit\/SessionCoordinator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Discord-style session-resume client. Runs as an actor so callers don’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have to worry about thread-safety; you can poke it from your transport"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"task and from the main actor freely."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionCoordinator","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Architecture","level":1,"type":"heading","anchor":"Architecture"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The coordinator owns three pieces of state:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The in-memory ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state"},{"type":"text","text":" (handshaking \/ replaying \/ live \/ disconnected)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A persistent ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(sessionId, lastSeq)"},{"text":" cursor in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionStorage"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A heartbeat timer that fires while the connection is healthy.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":